	quest.07253046B18F4CEB.quest_desc: ["Adds an empty-hand climb mode for vertical ropes in Create: Aeronautics. Right-click with bare hands to grab on, W/S to climb, Space to jump off, Sneak to let go. "]
	quest.07DA082B6A60842F.quest_desc: [
		"To start out you'll need to use sand paper on it, you can do this by holding the andesite in your off hand and then holding right mouse button with the sandpaper in you main hand."
		""
		"Once you have a Millstone or Mechanical Belt Grinder you can automate this process."
		""
		"Follow the optional tree bellow on making the sand paper if you need help"
