		"You stumbled out and headed towards the nearest &6escape pod&r. The next thing you remember is watching as your ship &cexplodes&r through the &6escape pod&r window"
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"Now you open your eyes, gazing out on to this &2strange world&r."
		""
		"Will you ever be able to go home?"
	]
