	quest.11C0C7106878A06E.quest_desc: [
		"Placing a pipe on top lets you extract the Carbon Dioxide, pump it into a Smokestack to release it into the atmosphere."
		""
		"The Creosote is pumped out any other side. Pump any excess Creosote into A Flarestack to burn it off."
		""
		"Can be placed up to 5x5 and even works as singular blocks (makes it hard to pump stuff out and put coal in when it's that small tho)"
		""
		"3x3 is what I recommend."
		""
		"You can also make Coke in a normal blast furnace, but you won't get any creosote, and you'll be needing some of that soon."
	]
	quest.11C0C7106878A06E.quest_subtitle: "Put Coal into a Coke Oven"
	quest.11C0C7106878A06E.title: "We Need Coke"
