	quest.1587CFDDCAC75EBB.quest_desc: ["Pairing the &6Crafting Terminal&r with a &9Storage&r network created with one of the mods &9Storage&r Controllers to make a main central &9Storage&r is one of the biggest Quality of Life upgrades you can make."]
	quest.1587CFDDCAC75EBB.quest_subtitle: "You can put one of these onto you Storage Controler of choice for a AE2/RS like system"
