	quest.23A9162C3CB4C816.quest_desc: [""]
	quest.23A9162C3CB4C816.title: "Here you will learn about automating resource gatering"
	quest.23E63FE310272BDA.quest_desc: [
		"You can create a waypoint on the map with a right click."
		""
		"A immportant part of playing this modpack is Forceloading chunks, normally in minecraft once an object moves outside of you chunk range it stops simulating, this means things like power generators, automatic ore miners, etc, all stop running. Obviously this is a problem when you are on the moon, to fix this. When a chunk is forceloaded it keeps being simulated all the time, you want to forceload the chunks any automation is in that you want to keep running while you're way from it."
		""
		"With the map open, drag while holding the right mouse button to select an area, then \"Clam Selected\" then do it again on the same area and \"Forceload Selected\"."
	]
	quest.23E63FE310272BDA.quest_subtitle: "Press (M) by default to open it"
