	quest.26D173B5484CD84E.quest_subtitle: "\"Here Hector entered, with a spear eleven cubits long in his hand; the bronze point gleamed in front of him, and was fastened to the shaft of the spear by a ring of gold.\"--Homer"
	quest.26D173B5484CD84E.title: "Making Brass"
	quest.278A1862BB5A26AE.quest_desc: ["Remember you can search for everything added by a mod using &9@modname&r, such as &9@create&r or &9@deep&r using the search box at the bottom of you screen."]
	quest.278A1862BB5A26AE.quest_subtitle: "It lets you build Submarines to help you explore the depths of the ocean"
	quest.278A1862BB5A26AE.title: "This Modpack Includes Create: Deep Seas"
	quest.27EA211485683A20.quest_subtitle: "Gives lots of pebbles as a byproduct"
	quest.281F9ED38AA62F4F.quest_desc: [
		"A &6Hot Air Envelope&r (and the one with shaft) can be used to construct balloons. A balloon must be enclosed everywhere except at the bottom."
		""
		"When the balloon is big enough, it can be used to fly a Simulated &9Contraption&r."
	]
	quest.281F9ED38AA62F4F.quest_subtitle: "[Click to read]"
	quest.284393BA288755DC.quest_desc: [
		"The Extra resorces are when sifted with a Steel Mesh or better."
		""
		"Gravel: special, in that it can give smaller amounts of: Iron, Copper, Gold, and some Clay. You can make gravel by putting cobblestone into a millstone, good for starting out."
		""
		"Deepslate: &0Coal&r, Extra, more &0Coal&r"
		""
		"Diorite: &7Iron&r, Extra, more &7Iron&r"
		""
		"Andesite: &cCopper&r, Extra, &2Zinc&r"
		""
		"Granite: &6Gold&r, Extra, &9Quartz&r"
		""
		"Sand: &4Redstone&r, Extra, &4Rutile&r"
		""
		"Dust: &2Zinc&r, Extra, &8Lead&r&r"
		""
		"Crushed Basalt: Salt, Extra, &dAmethyst&r"
		""
		"Calcite: Bone Meal, Extra, &8Graphite&r"
		""
		"Tuff: &8Ash&r, Extra, &eSulfur&r"
		""
		"Blackstone: &8Ash&r, Extra, &eSulfur&r"
		""
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"You can find these by exploring the world. The intention is that you place the mechanical extruder on stones you find in the world, encouraging you to use trains or aero vehicles to transport the resources back to your base, however this is minecraft so you can just pick up the blocks and make the extruders in your base."
		""
		"You can play in whatever way would be more fun for you :)"
	]
