	quest.35838DAE1FF80E9E.quest_desc: ["This modpack uses the mod \"Picky Wheels\" it nerfs Windmills, they now need enough open space for \"air to circulate\" mean they don't work underground or in space"]
	quest.35838DAE1FF80E9E.quest_subtitle: "Useful for remote automation"
	quest.35838DAE1FF80E9E.title: "Wind Power"
	quest.35BECE5AF504944C.quest_subtitle: "You need 2 on the Vat for it to work"
	quest.35BECE5AF504944C.title: "Electrolysis Machine"
	quest.35CD70FC3C598ACB.quest_desc: [
		"The mod pack already has a nearly as good as it can be performance mod list, and I've done what I can to give the best framerates while making the game look and feel great, but if your frame rate isn't good enough here's what to do!"
		""
		"Remove or change the settings of Distant Horizons, You can increase the CPU load and go afk for a bit, then lower it down."
		""
		"Lower shader settings. or use less demanding shaders. Proton will give you pretty good performance."
		""
		"Remove visual effect mods"
		""
		"Remove Concurrent Chunk Management Engine, this will slow down your chunk gen speed so it's a trade off."
		""
		"Use Observable And Spark to find what's lagging you game, Google those."
		""
		"Add in Mellow shaders and use that instead of the built in options."
		""
		"Disable FancyToasts and Disable all Toasts in Sodium Extras in video settings"
		""
		"Disable Better Leaves"
		""
		"Don't make stuff in the world that will tank you frame rate."
		""
		"play with no shaders &0RIP&r."
	]
	quest.35CD70FC3C598ACB.title: "Getting Better Performance"
	quest.35FA06BB7D542640.quest_subtitle: "The nature's compass let's you search for biomes"
	quest.35FA06BB7D542640.title: "Looking for somewhere?"
	quest.3699AFF463A003C7.quest_desc: ["Now on to Chapter 4, where you will further process these into useful stuff, notably &7Titanium&r and &bPlastic&r, both of which are needed for going into space"]
	quest.3699AFF463A003C7.quest_subtitle: "You Have Destroyed This Planet With Industrialization"
	quest.3699AFF463A003C7.title: "Congratulations "
	quest.36B8327F337926AE.quest_desc: [
		"These Diesel Engines are a big step up for both &6SU&r and with the use of Alternators, &eElectrical Power (FE)&r"
		""
		"They take all kinds of Fuel, not just &6Diesel"
		""
		"&rThe Turbo and Silencer are attachments that can be apllied to an engine with right mouse, the Turbo increases how many &6SU&r the engine puts out at the cost of increased fuel consumption"
	]
	quest.36B8327F337926AE.quest_subtitle: "NOW THAT'S A LOTTA STRESS!"
