	quest.4400DBE1E9F2D415.quest_desc: [
		"&6SU&r (&6Stress Units&r) is the kind of power used in the Create mod and its addons."
		""
		"Machines use &6stress&r to function, working faster and using an amount of stress proportional to the &cRPM&r (Revolutions Per Minute) "
		""
		"You can see the &6SU&r and &4RPM&r of a machine while wearing the &6Engineer's Goggles&r."
		""
		"You can measure the &6SU&r and &4RPM&r of a whole network with a Speedometer and Stressometer."
		""
		"The maximum rotation speed of a component is 256 RPM. Any more and components added to speed up further, such as a cogwheel, will break."
	]
	quest.4400DBE1E9F2D415.quest_subtitle: "Powering things with Create"
