	quest.544C1D0CBB98B55F.quest_desc: [
		"Then heat the &eResin&r in a Compressor with a Campfire or &6Burner&r placed under it and you get &8Rubber&r, then press that to get &8Rubber Sheets&r."
		""
		"Now you can start using belts to move stuff around, or make some tires and move your self around."
		""
