	quest.604AD67A133DFD56.quest_desc: [
		"The main way you progress in the modpack is with completing quests, and many of those require a research pack. "
		""
		"They are also used to unlock things."
		""
		"Other than the first starter pack, you'll need to finish making them in a lab, read more in the Research - Overview Quests"
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"You can complete skip the Research system if you don't want to play with it."
	]
