		"But if you're lazy then here are the most important ones and what key I use for it."
		""
		"M - Open Map"
		""
		"` - Open Quests"
		""
		"C - Zoom"
		""
		"B - Open Backpack (You need to make one first)"
		""
		"Hold \"Alt\" - Effortless Building"
	]
	quest.69C31EEEA8F12E30.title: "Hotkeys"
