	quest.6D933FEB60D721C2.quest_desc: [
		"Create Sifter adds ways of \"Sifting\" blocks into various resources, using it we can setup fully automated &0Coal&r, &7Iron&r, &cCopper&r, &2Zinc&r, &6Gold&r, and &4Redstone&r."
		""
		"Paired with the mechanical extruder, we are able to make infinite amounts of all the core resources needed to progress."
		""
		"Craft the Sifter to continue"
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"Now is also a good time to start setting up a more permant base, with Water Wheels, Windmills, or Steampower to power your automation. You can learn more in the \"Power\" Chapter of \"Guides\""
	]
	quest.6D933FEB60D721C2.title: "Automating Ores"
	quest.6DA08FCE64230EC2.quest_subtitle: "Puts things in and takes things out, horizontally"
	quest.6DA08FCE64230EC2.title: "Funnels"
	quest.6DD7733077CBF851.quest_desc: [
		"Both &bFunctional Storage&r and &4Sophisticated Storage&r work fairly similarly, they both add high capacity and connectable &9Storage&r."
		""
		"&bFunctional Storage&r has &6Drawers&r that can hold huge amounts of one type of item (&4Sophisticated&r has &6Drawers&r too btw)"
		""
		"&4Sophisticated Storage&r is best for storing a large varirty of items with it's huge &6Chests&r and &6Barrels&r."
		""
		""
		"I put both in the pack since I actually like using both for different things."
	]
	quest.6DD7733077CBF851.quest_subtitle: "The blue pill or the red pill"
	quest.6DD7733077CBF851.title: "Chose You Path"
	quest.6E14036FB00B2830.quest_subtitle: "If you really can't stand losing it"
	quest.6E14036FB00B2830.title: "Stone Furnace"
	quest.6EB4DC6E08D3CC91.quest_subtitle: "The Void Upgrade is VERY useful"
	quest.6EB4DC6E08D3CC91.title: "Enhance What You Can Do With Drawers"
	quest.6F60DDE4EF47CC46.quest_desc: ["Along with the various Mechanisms, these will be one of your first big step ups in complexity for automation"]
	quest.6F60DDE4EF47CC46.quest_subtitle: "You should automate making these (Goes in Research Packs)"
	quest.6F60DDE4EF47CC46.title: "The Beating Heart of The Engine"
	quest.6F7D9858F9D3DFA5.quest_desc: ["You will probably want to have setup some more robust automation before advancing to Alloys, you'll need a lot of &0Coal&r, &7Iron&r, &cCopper&r, &2Zinc&r, and lots of &6Stress Units&r to power your new machines"]
	quest.6F7D9858F9D3DFA5.quest_subtitle: "\"There never was a good knife made of bad steel.\"--Benjamin Franklin"
	quest.6F7D9858F9D3DFA5.title: "Here you will start making Alloys"
	quest.6F7EC70AC0BFC7F6.quest_subtitle: "\"I think we all agree, the past is over.\"--George W. Bush"
	quest.6F7EC70AC0BFC7F6.title: "Here you will find, harvest, and refine Oil"
	quest.6F92785772A033A7.quest_subtitle: "Heat and Mix, &eSulfur Dust&r, &aPropylene&r and &5Ethylene&r to make &8Rubber Sheet Blocks&r"
	quest.6F92785772A033A7.title: "Synthetic Rubber "
	quest.6F92DDF06E29E4E4.quest_desc: [
		"Place the three pieces of paper with the coordinates that you made with the Telescope inside."
		""
		"If the coordinates are far enough apart, you will get a map to the Moon."
		""
		"When you arrive, you get a Ticket for returning Home."
	]
	quest.6F92DDF06E29E4E4.quest_subtitle: "[Click to read]"
	quest.6F92DDF06E29E4E4.title: "&6Astronomy Table"
	quest.70BFEB8A9B7DFF58.quest_desc: [
		"&3Refined Storage&r is an &ooptional&r &9Storage&r system that uses &9Disks&r to store your items. like a &9AE2&r lite"
		""
		"Autocrafting and Wireless Grids are locked untill later on. You can decide to keep upgrading and continue using your &3Refined Storage&r system forever if you want. However, you will still have to engage with &9AE2&r to complete some of the endgame crafting but can keep using RS for storage if you prefer it. "
	]
	quest.70BFEB8A9B7DFF58.quest_subtitle: "Once you get to the Moon you can setup an RS system"
	quest.70BFEB8A9B7DFF58.title: "&3Refined Storage&r"
	quest.720BC83C7B638F10.quest_desc: [
		"You make them by clicking on a placed stripped log with an andesite alloy in your hand"
		""
		"To strip the log you place it on ground then right click while holding an axe"
	]
	quest.720BC83C7B638F10.quest_subtitle: "You make these in the world"
	quest.721B26A2C40EF2F0.quest_desc: [
		"I've made lots of custom recipes for this mod pack, if you don't know how to use EMI/JEI now's the time to learn"
		""
		"[ { \"text\": \"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=3jGJFdickUU\", \"underlined\": true, \"clickEvent\": { \"action\": \"open_url\", \"value\": \"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=3jGJFdickUU\" } } ]"
		""
		"Reminder you can hit \"R\" and \"U\" while hovering over an item to see how to make it and what it's used in, respectively. You can also search for all items from a specific mod by typing @ infront of the mod name \"&9@create&r\" for example."
	]
	quest.721B26A2C40EF2F0.title: "Using EMI/JEI"
	quest.721F93790C118CDC.quest_subtitle: "Lets you connect a bunch of Storages toghter"
	quest.7234E071EB62F6F9.quest_desc: [
		"Put the map in the rocket station and use the controls to launch."
		""
		"Don't forget to sit down or you'll get turned into paste"
	]
	quest.7234E071EB62F6F9.title: "Control Systems"
	quest.7304D8112F6CFE38.quest_desc: ["You make the Molds by stonecutting a blank one, you get that by pressing Graphite"]
	quest.7304D8112F6CFE38.quest_subtitle: "Pour the Molten Metal onto a Casting Basin or Casting Table with a Mold"
	quest.7304D8112F6CFE38.title: "Turning Molten Metals into Ingots"
	quest.734B034DC9746159.quest_subtitle: "Just craft it!"
	quest.738A6C2CDBCEC8EE.quest_subtitle: "Upgraded Chests and Barrels"
	quest.738A6C2CDBCEC8EE.title: "&4Sophisticated Storage&r"
	quest.74337C28AE7B4613.quest_subtitle: "Lets you generate stones, you'll make a lot of these at all phases of the game"
	quest.744A726B50654117.quest_desc: ["You'll need to get to &4Mars&r to make the &2Mekanism&r pipes and &5Mercury&r for the &6Oritech&r ones"]
	quest.744A726B50654117.quest_subtitle: "Doesn't need to be pumped"
	quest.744A726B50654117.title: "Advanced Pipes"
	quest.74E6A56FA87CC902.quest_desc: [""]
	quest.74E6A56FA87CC902.quest_subtitle: "Add Steel Dust to Titanium Tetrachloride and you get Raw Titanium"
	quest.756C89FAABDB6659.quest_desc: [
		"This modpack is still in &4ALPHA&r and much of the content has not been finished, tested, or refined. "
		""
		"Player discretion is advised."
	]
	quest.756C89FAABDB6659.title: "Warning!"
	quest.75A15F17831BFB39.quest_subtitle: "You'll need stuff from both &9Venus&r and &5Mercury&r to make the Cross Dimensional Upgrade"
	quest.75A15F17831BFB39.title: "Use Drones to Move Items To And From anywhere in the System"
	quest.75A301E28B3A4EB3.quest_desc: [
		"Pipe the &0Crude Oil&r directly into the &cDistillation Controller&r and pump out the refined liquids from each of the outputs. "
		""
		"&6Burners&r are required to heat it. The steel tanks can be 1x1, 2x2, or 3x3, the bigger it is the faster it will process the &0Oil&r, and the more Heat you can use."
		""
		"Depending on how tall you make the tower, you get different outputs. "
		""
		"At the minium size of 3 outputs you get &0Heavy oil&r, &6Diesel&r, and &eGasoline&r"
		""
		"Add two more outputs and you get &9Kerosene&r and &7LPG&r"
		""
		"One more output, &4Naphtha&r"
		""
		"Outputs can be set to void excess fluid or to stop refining when they are full."
		""
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		""
		"&9Kerosene&r is what you will use for rocket fuel untill you can make better types from the &7Moon&r"
		""
		"&4Naphtha&r is what you refine into Plastic and Rubber"
		""
		"When used in the &cLiquid Burner&r, &6Diesel&r and &9Kerosene&r can only give \"Heated\""
		""
		"&eGasoline&r and &7LPG&r are both are able to give \"Super Heated\""
	]
	quest.75A301E28B3A4EB3.quest_subtitle: "You place the controller onto the tanks"
	quest.75A301E28B3A4EB3.title: "The Distillation Tower"
	quest.75D4AEE5CE3C5B95.quest_subtitle: "Time to Start Building our First Rocket Ship"
	quest.75D4AEE5CE3C5B95.title: "Woah, You Did It!"
	quest.76799A94679CF3DB.quest_desc: [
		"You will Progress by completing the Chapters in each Phase. "
		""
		"This modpack has lots of changes to normal minecraft and mod progresson, you'll need to use EMI/JEI a lot."
		""
		"If you want a less handholdy experience, you should be able to figure things out by just reading the &9Help&r Chapter."
		""
		"If you want, you can bypass the Research Packs mechanic, go read the Research Overview to learn how."
	]
	quest.76799A94679CF3DB.quest_subtitle: "Please read the modpack page description before playing."
	quest.76799A94679CF3DB.title: "Welcome to CASE!"
	quest.76C4D5035B701578.quest_desc: [
		"The Extra resorces are when sifted with a Steel Mesh or better."
		""
		"Gravel: special, in that it can give smaller amounts of: Iron, Copper, Gold, and some Clay. You can make gravel by putting cobblestone into a millstone, good for starting out."
		""
		"Deepslate: &0Coal&r, Extra, more &0Coal&r"
		""
		"Diorite: &7Iron&r, Extra, more &7Iron&r"
		""
		"Andesite: &cCopper&r, Extra, &2Zinc&r"
		""
		"Granite: &6Gold&r, Extra, &9Quartz&r"
		""
		"Sand: &4Redstone&r, Extra, &9Quartz&r"
		""
		"Dust: &2Zinc&r, Extra, &8Lead&r&r"
		""
		"Crushed Basalt: Salt, Extra, &dAmethyst&r"
		""
		"Calcite: Bone Meal, Extra, &8Graphite&r"
		""
		"Tuff: &8Ash&r, Extra, &eSulfur&r"
		""
		"Blackstone: &8Ash&r, Extra, &eSulfur&r"
		""
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"You can find these by exploring the world. The intention is that you place the mechanical extruder on stones you find in the world, encouraging you to use trains or aero vehicles to transport the resources back to your base, however this is minecraft so you can just pick up the blocks and make the extruders in your base."
		""
		"You can play in whatever way would be more fun for you :)"
	]
	quest.76C4D5035B701578.quest_subtitle: "You get different resources depending on what block you put into the sifter "
	quest.76C4D5035B701578.title: "Types of Blocks to Sift"
	quest.76C8F4D5142D0485.quest_desc: [
		"Place the Mixer on top of the Vat and power it with &6SU&r. "
		""
		"You right click while holding a Mixer Blade OR Centrifuge to put it on to the Mixer for it to work."
	]
	quest.7751AD6B5211B677.quest_desc: ["You can craft a Diving Helmet and a Backtank to breath underwater, now with curio support so you can keep you shirt on."]
	quest.7751AD6B5211B677.quest_subtitle: "UNDA DA SEA"
	quest.78BF2FD6473CDD8B.quest_subtitle: "Pour the molten Brass into the casting mold to get a Brass Ingot"
	quest.78BF2FD6473CDD8B.title: "You Have Acquired Brass!"
	quest.78DCB113E741A564.quest_desc: [
		"Right click while holding the scanner, after a few secounds it will tell you how much &0Oil&r is in the currently occupied chunk."
		""
		"&0Crude Oil&r can be found in High or Normal Deposits. "
		""
		"High Deposits are only found in \"True\" Desert biomes, meaning ones with \"Desert\" in the name, and in Deep Oceans. They are infinite and are more common"
		""
		"Normal Deposits can be found in normal Oceans and in \"Hot\" biomes, such as savannas and badlands, however they are finite and some chunks might only have a tiny bit in them, and they are less common."
	]
	quest.78DCB113E741A564.quest_subtitle: "Oil Deposits &4ONLY!&r spawn in Hot, Desert like or Ocean biomes"
	quest.78DCB113E741A564.title: "Finding Oil"
	quest.797D8F18C9417930.quest_desc: ["You can get flint from Sand or Gravel by sifting it with a basic mesh"]
	quest.797D8F18C9417930.quest_subtitle: "The modpack changes wood tools into flint ones"
	quest.797D8F18C9417930.title: "Flint Tools"
	quest.7A77A80FE1F1E719.quest_desc: ["You can get most of the stones infinitely with this. Just place the extruder on top of the type of stone you want to make and power it."]
	quest.7A77A80FE1F1E719.quest_subtitle: "It's really that easy? It's that easy"
	quest.7A77A80FE1F1E719.title: "Automating Andesite"
	quest.7AB3DBE39A1CF8AA.quest_desc: ["Rubber is added in the place of dried kelp for Create mod items, you can get it from trees early game, and from &0Oil&r later on in higher amounts"]
	quest.7AB3DBE39A1CF8AA.quest_subtitle: "You need a lot of this stuff"
	quest.7AB3DBE39A1CF8AA.title: "Making Rubber"
	quest.7AE22F32C3D0FDAD.quest_subtitle: "You can connect things to your RS system"
	quest.7AE22F32C3D0FDAD.title: "Using Your RS System"
	quest.7AF5E12828487515.quest_desc: ["Useful for breaking down stones into other blocks for using in the sifter. Such as Cobblestone into Gravel."]
	quest.7AF5E12828487515.quest_subtitle: "Put in the raw ore, get the crushed version out"
	quest.7AF5E12828487515.title: "No More Sandpaper"
	quest.7B32321413C4B4BF.quest_subtitle: "Pretty useful right now"
	quest.7B32321413C4B4BF.title: "Gravel or Sand Gives Clay And Flint"
	quest.7BCF4DBDA86999E3.quest_subtitle: "Lets you make dynamically load chunks"
	quest.7BFF3FFC61C780A2.quest_desc: [
		"Steel is a primary resource, you can think of it as an upgrade of Iron. It's used for lots of stuff in the modpack so best make lots of it."
		""
		"You can unlock an easier and more efficient way to make steel once you get to &4Mars&r, using Mekanism."
	]
	quest.7BFF3FFC61C780A2.quest_subtitle: "Steel can be used to get Oil and make better Cogs"
	quest.7BFF3FFC61C780A2.title: "Making Steel"
	quest.7CCA04AA660D3A80.quest_desc: [
		"You can hang lanterns in the curio slot for hands free lighting! "
		""
		"Also hangable on walls!"
		""
		"Click the little dot thing on the top left of your character model in the inventory screen to open the curios list, or bind the hotkey for it."
	]
	quest.7CCA04AA660D3A80.quest_subtitle: "Wearable!"
	quest.7CDEE2D1FCCA882A.quest_subtitle: "You can store lots of things in disks"
	quest.7CDEE2D1FCCA882A.title: "Compact Storage"
	quest.7D383F8C45BAA741.quest_desc: [
		"Heat Water in a Distillation Tower with 3 outputs "
		""
		"You can also make it with Hydrochloric Acid and Sodium Hydroxide or by adding Salt to Water"
	]
	quest.7D383F8C45BAA741.title: "Making Brine"
	quest.7D668254D1602303.quest_subtitle: "\"Joyfully to the breeze royal Odysseus spread his sail, and with his rudder skillfully he steered.\"--Homer"
	quest.7D668254D1602303.title: "Here you will build your first Rocket"
	quest.7D9DD41C4D3D4DF9.title: "Moving Power (FE) with Wires"
	quest.7E7784B76F0D3CDD.quest_subtitle: "Use this to mix two molten metals together to create an alloy"
	quest.7EA2EB3AD329F225.quest_desc: [
		"You can preview the world around you if you want to see whats near you by doing the following."
		""
		"If you aren't at spawn then start with /chunky center, if you are skip it."
		""
		"/chunky radius 2000"
		""
		"/chunky shape circle"
		""
		"/chunky start"
		""
		"Wait for the progess bar at the top to finish then, Open Map(M) > Setting top left > page 5 > bottom left Reload All Regions"
		""
		"Wait for that and then you can see a large radius around you"
	]
	quest.7EA2EB3AD329F225.quest_subtitle: "Yes I want google maps on my crashlanded alien world please"
	quest.7EA2EB3AD329F225.title: "Farseek"
